lient | runtime-integration | Configured downstream rest api client |\n146\t| TGIS generation service | gRPC client | runtime-integration | Configured downstream grpc client |\n147\t\n148\t## Network Architecture\n149\t\n150\t### Services\n151\t\n152\t| Service Name | Type | Port | Target Port | Protocol | Encryption | Auth | Exposure |\n153\t|------------|----|----|-----------|--------|----------|----|--------|\n154\t| guardrails-server | N/A (binary) | 8033/TCP | 8033 | HTTP/HTTPS | TLS 1.2+ (optional) | Passthrough headers, optional mTLS | Internal |\n155\t| health-server | N/A (binary) | 8034/TCP | 8034 | HTTP | None | None | Internal |\n156\t\n157\t### Ingress\n158\t\n159\t| Name | Type | Hosts | Port | Protocol | Encryption | TLS Mode | Exposure |\n160\t|----|----|-----|----|--------|----------|--------|--------|\n161\t\n162\t### Egress\n163\t\n164\t| Destination | Port | Protocol | Encryption | Auth | Purpose |\n165\t|-----------|----|--------|----------|----|-------|\n166\t| Chunker services | 8085 | gRPC | TLS (optional, configurable) | None | Configured downstream grpc client |\n167\t| Detector health services | 8081 | HTTP/HTTPS | None | None | Configured downstream rest health client |\n168\t| Detector services | 8080 | HTTP/HTTPS | TLS (optional, configurable) | Bearer token (optional) | Configured downstream rest api client |\n169\t| TGIS generation service | 8033 | gRPC | None | None | Configured downstream grpc client |\n170\t\n171\t## Security\n172\t\n173\t### RBAC - Cluster Roles\n174\t\n175\t| Role Name | API Group | Resources | Verbs |\n176\t|---------|---------|---------|-----|\n177\t\n178\t### RBAC - Role Bindings\n179\t\n180\t| Binding Name | Namespace | Role | Service Account |\n181\t|------------|---------|----|---------------|\n182\t\n183\t### Secrets\n184\t\n185\t| Secret Name | Type | Purpose | Provisioned By | Auto-Rotate |\n186\t|-----------|----|-------|--------------|-----------|\n187\t| TLS server cert/key | kubernetes.io/tls | Rust 